* Cyclohexane (CHEX) as a CGenFF append residue.
* Stock CGenFF has no plain cyclohexane; the only one in the CHARMM tree is
* RESI CHEX in top_all35_ethers.rtf, typed with the legacy ether types CC32A /
* HCA2A. Mixing that file in would pull a second force field into the run, so
* this re-types the same molecule with CGenFF CG321 (CH2) and HGA2 (H on CH2).
* Both are fully parameterised in stock par_all36_cgenff.prm:
*   BOND  CG321 CG321  222.50  1.5300      BOND  CG321 HGA2  309.00  1.1110
*   ANGLE CG321 CG321 CG321  58.35 113.60  (Urey-Bradley 11.16 2.56100)
*   ANGLE CG321 CG321 HGA2   26.50 110.10  (Urey-Bradley 22.53 2.17900)
*   ANGLE HGA2  CG321 HGA2   35.50 109.00  (Urey-Bradley  5.40 1.80200)
* so no extra parameter file is needed.
* Charges are the standard CGenFF apolar-CH2 values (C -0.18, H +0.09), giving
* the neutral, essentially non-polar apolar reference solvent of Turan et al.
* NOTE: keep this title block free of interior lone-asterisk lines - CHARMM ends
* the title at the first one and parses everything after it as RTF commands.
*

RESI CHEX          0.00 ! C6H12, cyclohexane (CGenFF types)
GROUP
ATOM C1   CG321    -0.18
ATOM H11  HGA2      0.09
ATOM H12  HGA2      0.09
GROUP
ATOM C2   CG321    -0.18
ATOM H21  HGA2      0.09
ATOM H22  HGA2      0.09
GROUP
ATOM C3   CG321    -0.18
ATOM H31  HGA2      0.09
ATOM H32  HGA2      0.09
GROUP
ATOM C4   CG321    -0.18
ATOM H41  HGA2      0.09
ATOM H42  HGA2      0.09
GROUP
ATOM C5   CG321    -0.18
ATOM H51  HGA2      0.09
ATOM H52  HGA2      0.09
GROUP
ATOM C6   CG321    -0.18
ATOM H61  HGA2      0.09
ATOM H62  HGA2      0.09

BOND C1 C2   C2 C3   C3 C4   C4 C5   C5 C6   C6 C1
BOND C1 H11  C1 H12
BOND C2 H21  C2 H22
BOND C3 H31  C3 H32
BOND C4 H41  C4 H42
BOND C5 H51  C5 H52
BOND C6 H61  C6 H62

! Chair conformer: ring torsion alternating +/-55.9 deg, C-C 1.530, C-C-C 111.5.
IC C1   C2   C3   C4    1.5300  111.50   55.90  111.50   1.5300
IC C2   C3   C4   C5    1.5300  111.50  -55.90  111.50   1.5300
IC C3   C4   C5   C6    1.5300  111.50   55.90  111.50   1.5300
IC C4   C5   C6   C1    1.5300  111.50  -55.90  111.50   1.5300
IC C5   C6   C1   C2    1.5300  111.50   55.90  111.50   1.5300
IC C6   C1   C2   C3    1.5300  111.50  -55.90  111.50   1.5300
IC C2   C1   *C6  H61   1.5300  111.50  120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C2   C1   *C6  H62   1.5300  111.50 -120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C3   C2   *C1  H11   1.5300  111.50  120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C3   C2   *C1  H12   1.5300  111.50 -120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C4   C3   *C2  H21   1.5300  111.50  120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C4   C3   *C2  H22   1.5300  111.50 -120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C5   C4   *C3  H31   1.5300  111.50  120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C5   C4   *C3  H32   1.5300  111.50 -120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C6   C5   *C4  H41   1.5300  111.50  120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C6   C5   *C4  H42   1.5300  111.50 -120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C1   C6   *C5  H51   1.5300  111.50  120.00  109.50   1.1110
IC C1   C6   *C5  H52   1.5300  111.50 -120.00  109.50   1.1110

